<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tachyon — L'internet davvero libero</title>

  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>

<body>

  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg" id="mainNav">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">
        <div class="brand-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="2.8" fill="white" />
            <line x1="10" y1="2" x2="10" y2="6.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <line x1="10" y1="13.5" x2="10" y2="18" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <line x1="2" y1="10" x2="6.5" y2="10" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            <line x1="13.5" y1="10" x2="18" y2="10" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="brand-name">Tachyon</span>
      </a>

      <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navContent">
        <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navContent">
        <ul class="navbar-nav mx-auto gap-1">
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="technology.html">Come funziona</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="network.html">Network</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="tachycoins.html">TachyCoins</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="story.html">Come siamo nati</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="download.html" class="nav-link btn-nav-cta ms-lg-3">Scarica Tachyon →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="hero-video">
        <source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-aerial-view-of-city-buildings-and-skyscrapers-4301-large.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container hero-content">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-8 col-xl-7">
          <div class="hero-badge">
            <div class="hero-badge-dot"></div>
            <span class="hero-badge-text">Open Source · Now in Beta</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Internet pulito<br>
            come <span class="accent">la natura</span><br>
            <span class="dim">— creato per tutti</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Tachyon <b>vuole</b> ricostruire il web da zero. Decentralizzato, peer-to-peer, tutto cio' e' possibile
            grazie al nostro algoritmo di compressione. 0 Server Farms. Impatto ecologico minimo. Solo un internet piu'
            veloce e giusto per tutti.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="download.html" class="btn-primary-green">Scarica Tachyon →</a>
            <a href="technology.html" class="btn-ghost-white">Leggi qualche specifica tecnica</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-hint">
      <span>scroll</span>
      <div class="scroll-arrow"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="impact-bar">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-0 justify-content-center">

        <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
          <div class="impact-stat">
            <div class="impact-num">
              <span class="counter" data-target="0">0</span><span class="unit"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-label">Utenti attivi attuali</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
          <div class="impact-stat">
            <div class="impact-num">
              <span class="counter" data-target="0">0</span><span class="unit"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="impact-label">Nodi attivi attuali</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row mb-5 reveal">
        <div class="col-lg-5 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
          <p class="section-eyebrow">// Come funziona?</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Diverso<br>dall'origine</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-7 d-flex align-items-end">
          <p class="section-subtitle">Ci basiamo su 3 principi. Non sono funzionalita', bensi' le fondamenta di Tachyon.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4 reveal">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Decentralizzazione</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Con la nostra rete mesh non esiste un serve centrale, ogni utente infatti aiuta ad
              espandere la rete e a migliorare le prestazioni</p>
            <span class="feature-tag">peer-to-peer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Velocita' mozzafiato</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Il nostro algoritmo di compressione (54:1) permette un afflusso di dati mai visto
              prima senza perdere perfomance</p>
            <span class="feature-tag">alta prestazione</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">🌿</div>
            <h3 class="feature-title">Impatto C02 minimo</h3>
            <p class="feature-desc">Non avendo dei grandi datacenter per hostare i serivizi. I consumi di Tachyon sono
              in prossimita' dello zero</p>
            <span class="feature-tag">-90% consumi</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission" id="mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

        <div class="col-md-6 reveal">
          <p class="section-eyebrow">// Il nostro impegno green</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="mission-title">La natura continua a <br>respirare.</h2>

          <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--slate-600);line-height:1.80;margin-bottom:20px;">
            Ogni minuto, l'infrastruttura tradizionale di internet brucia energia sufficiente ad alimentare migliaia di
            case. Abbiamo deciso di costruire qualcosa di diverso: un internet che gira sui dispositivi che già
            possiedi.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--slate-600);line-height:1.80;margin-bottom:36px;">
            Con Tachyon, il tuo smartphone è un nodo. Il tuo laptop è l'infrastruttura. La rete cresce con i suoi
            utenti, e così la sua sostenibilità.
          </p>



          <br>
          <a href="story.html" class="btn-mission">La nostra storia →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 reveal">
          <div class="mission-visual">
            <video autoplay muted playsinline class="mission-video">
              <source src="assets/natura1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
              Il tuo browser non supporta il video.
            </video>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="footer-brand-name">Tachyon</span>
          </div>
          <p class="footer-tagline">// Il nuovo internet · open source</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
          <div class="footer-col-title">Tecnologia dietro Tachyon</div>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="technology.html">Come Funziona</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/Mawku">GitHub</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="footer-divider">
      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
        <span class="footer-copyright">© 2026 Tachyon</span>
        <div class="footer-status">
          <div class="status-dot"></div> Network Online
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="js/script.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
